{"id":70267,"date":"2025-08-29T08:24:37","date_gmt":"2025-08-29T07:24:37","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=70267"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:21:45","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:21:45","slug":"trail-lagos-do-sabor","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/trail-lagos-do-sabor\/","title":{"rendered":"Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">O <strong>Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no domingo, <strong>22 de novembro de 2026<\/strong>, na aldeia de <strong>Sendim da Serra<\/strong>, concelho de <strong>Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9<\/strong> (distrito de <strong>Bragan\u00e7a<\/strong>), em associa\u00e7\u00e3o com o tradicional <strong>Festival Micol\u00f3gico<\/strong>. A partida e a meta est\u00e3o instaladas em frente ao edif\u00edcio da <strong>Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra<\/strong>, com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09:00<\/strong> para o <strong>Trail Lagos do Sabor (20 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Trail Curto (10 km)<\/strong>, seguindo-se \u00e0s <strong>09:05<\/strong> as corridas para escal\u00f5es jovens.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Integrado na marca territorial <strong>Running Place Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9<\/strong>, o percurso atravessa os trilhos da <strong>Serra da Gouveia<\/strong> e oferece miradouros privilegiados sobre os <strong>Lagos do Sabor<\/strong>, em pleno cora\u00e7\u00e3o de Tr\u00e1s-os-Montes. As provas principais t\u00eam um tempo limite de <strong>3 horas<\/strong> (encerramento da meta \u00e0s <strong>12:00<\/strong>) e contam com 5 postos de abastecimento no percurso de 20 km (3 s\u00f3lidos) e 2 postos no percurso de 10 km (1 s\u00f3lido).<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizado pela <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o Recreativa Alfandeguense (ARA)<\/strong> e pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9<\/strong>, com dire\u00e7\u00e3o t\u00e9cnica e certifica\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Associa\u00e7\u00e3o de Atletismo de Bragan\u00e7a<\/strong>, o evento distribui um <em>Prize Money<\/em> total de <strong>2.480 \u20ac<\/strong> (300 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba M\/F dos 20 km, pr\u00e9mios at\u00e9 ao 10\u00ba da geral, Top 3 local e Top 3 do Trail Curto), crach\u00e1 colecion\u00e1vel de <em>finisher<\/em>, duches no <strong>Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9<\/strong> e almo\u00e7o conv\u00edvio na tenda do Festival Micol\u00f3gico. Consulta o calend\u00e1rio nacional de provas de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/trail\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Trail Running em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">22 de Novembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra, Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9, Bragan\u00e7a<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot