amins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\u23f0 Partida: 09:05<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Sem Almo\u00e7o:<\/strong> Gratuito<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Com Almo\u00e7o:<\/strong> 12,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 15\/11\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e onde parte o Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, em frente ao edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra, no concelho de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 (distrito de Bragan\u00e7a). O Trail 20 km e o Trail Curto 10 km partem \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto as corridas para escal\u00f5es jovens t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:05.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que incluem?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026. No Trail Lagos do Sabor e no Trail Curto custam 15,00 \u20ac sem almo\u00e7o ou 25,00 \u20ac com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo (inclui crach\u00e1 de finisher, kit com brindes, abastecimentos, seguro e banho). Nas Provas Jovens a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita sem almo\u00e7o ou 12,00 \u20ac com almo\u00e7o (almo\u00e7o de acompanhante: 20,00 \u20ac com mata-bicho \u00e0s 09:30).<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e em que hor\u00e1rio funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O secretariado funciona no edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra no s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, e no domingo, 22 de novembro (dia da prova), entre as 07:45\/08:00 e as 08:55.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis ap\u00f3s a meta?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O tempo limite para concluir o Trail Lagos do Sabor e o Trail Curto \u00e9 de 3 horas (fecho da meta \u00e0s 12:00). Os atletas disp\u00f5em de duches nos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 at\u00e9 \u00e0s 12:30, cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio \u00e0s 12:30 e almo\u00e7o \u00e0s 13:30 na tenda do Festival Micol\u00f3gico.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como est\u00e3o distribu\u00eddos os 2.480 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (Prize Money)?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">No Trail Lagos do Sabor s\u00e3o premiados os 10 primeiros da geral M\/F (300 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 150 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 100 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba at\u00e9 10 \u20ac ao 10\u00ba) e os 3 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o local de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 M\/F (100 \u20ac, 60 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac), al\u00e9m de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita no GP das Cerejas 2027 para os vencedores de escal\u00e3o. No Trail Curto, o Top 3 M\/F recebe 100 \u20ac, 60 \u20ac e 40 \u20ac.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"endDate\": \"2026-11-22\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Alf\u00e2ndega Da F\u00e9, Bragan\u00e7a\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Alf\u00e2ndega Da F\u00e9\", \"addressRegion\": \"Bragan\u00e7a\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"O Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026 realiza-se a 22 de novembro em Sendim da Serra, Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 (Bragan\u00e7a). Trail de 20 km, 10 km e Jovens. Garante o teu dorsal!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/10\/cartaz-trail-lagos-do-sabor.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Lagos do Sabor 20 km (Serra da Gouveia & Lagos do Sabor)\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/566\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Trail Curto 10 km\", \"price\": \"15.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/566\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Provas Jovens (Benjamins, Infantis, Iniciados e Juvenis)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/sinctime.com\/evento\/566\"}]}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde parte o Trail Lagos do Sabor 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 22 de novembro de 2026, em frente ao edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra, no concelho de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 (distrito de Bragan\u00e7a). O Trail 20 km e o Trail Curto 10 km partem \u00e0s 09:00, enquanto as corridas para escal\u00f5es jovens t\u00eam in\u00edcio \u00e0s 09:05.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o os pre\u00e7os de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e o que incluem?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 15 de novembro de 2026. No Trail Lagos do Sabor e no Trail Curto custam 15,00 \u20ac sem almo\u00e7o ou 25,00 \u20ac com almo\u00e7o inclu\u00eddo (inclui crach\u00e1 de finisher, kit com brindes, abastecimentos, seguro e banho). Nas Provas Jovens a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o \u00e9 gratuita sem almo\u00e7o ou 12,00 \u20ac com almo\u00e7o (almo\u00e7o de acompanhante: 20,00 \u20ac com mata-bicho \u00e0s 09:30).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e em que hor\u00e1rio funciona o secretariado para levantamento de dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O secretariado funciona no edif\u00edcio da Junta de Freguesia de Sendim da Serra no s\u00e1bado, 21 de novembro, e no domingo, 22 de novembro (dia da prova), entre as 07:45\/08:00 e as 08:55.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite e que servi\u00e7os est\u00e3o dispon\u00edveis ap\u00f3s a meta?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O tempo limite para concluir o Trail Lagos do Sabor e o Trail Curto \u00e9 de 3 horas (fecho da meta \u00e0s 12:00). Os atletas disp\u00f5em de duches nos balne\u00e1rios do Est\u00e1dio Municipal de Alf\u00e2ndega da F\u00e9 at\u00e9 \u00e0s 12:30, cerim\u00f3nia de p\u00f3dio \u00e0s 12:30 e almo\u00e7o \u00e0s 13:30 na tenda do Festival Micol\u00f3gico.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como est\u00e3o distribu\u00eddos os 2.480 \u20ac em pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios (Prize Money)?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"No Trail Lagos do Sabor s\u00e3o premiados os 10 primeiros da geral M\/F (300 \u20ac ao 1\u00ba, 150 \u20ac ao 2\u00ba, 100 \u20ac ao 3\u00ba at\u00e9 10 \u20ac ao 10\u00ba) e os 3 primeiros da classifica\u00e7\u00e3o local 